Behaviours preserved rather than fixed:[0m[0m
- No [38;5;10margc[0m check. [38;5;10matoi[0m is reimplemented to match glibc ([38;5;10m(int)strtol(s, NULL, 10)[0m): whitespace skip, optional sign, stop at first non-digit, saturate at the [38;5;10mlong[0m bounds then truncate to [38;5;10mint[0m.[0m[0m
